{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VajvL2cfll1795670391.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一條約四米長的巨鱷，因為眼盲難以在野外環境生存。牠早前在哥斯達黎獲救，當局一直為牠尋覓合適居所。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"crocodile.1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026mXrVWUxClV1795670408.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>及至近日，當局安排移送巨鱷到克波斯(Quepos)熱帶雨林生態樂園Canopy Safari 居住，讓園區人員照顧這條因視力問題而需特別保護的鱷魚。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"crocodile.2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026k7BqWN0zn41795670431.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>Canopy Safari 創立於1997年，是哥斯黎黎加歷史最悠久的高空滑索生態冒險樂園之一，位於中部太平洋沿岸的克波斯與曼努埃爾安東尼奧(Manuel Antonio)近郊的私人熱帶雨林保護區內。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T00:04:28.872968+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":224,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T23:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T20:17:32.984194+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T23:57:37.452211+00:00","content_hash":"987ce7b70ff4b2dcf38f14ad9caf89dfabf968ee42caf02ed6bbdea3ab5dfaeb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T00:04:28.872968+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}